:: day3_hub [nobr]
<!--
  PLACEHOLDER   the current end of the public build's content
  (female route). Day 2 is real content now; Day 3 ("Learning" -
  the Queen's visit, the lessons begin) is not yet written.
  Replace with real Day 3 content and its own day3fInit flag block
  when written, and move the <<endOfContentNoticeFemale>> call
  below down to wherever the new content's own final passage ends.
-->
<div class="day-transition">
  <h2><<print formatDayNumber($dayNumber)>>   Learning</h2>
  <p>(Day 3 content not yet written. Days -2 through Day 2 are fully playable end to end on the female route.)</p>
  <p><<print $mcName>>, <<print $mcTitle>>. Height <<print $mcHeight>>,
  bust <<print $mcBust>>. Stress: <<print $stress>> | Energy: <<print $energy>></p>
</div>

<<endOfContentNoticeFemale>>
